3. New meta-hypothesis suggested by the data
   The useful symmetric sector is not the raw Cartan S of A; it is
   the functorial lift Omega(T), transfer M(T), or weighted attention.
   Conditioning on t3 removes the first centered skew-chaos term,
   but H variation remains exactly where Omega gains independent sets.
   Search target: residual H within fixed t3 fibers, ordered by alpha2.
